  "reason": "Existing evidence shows multimodal singleprofile models (config_016/017) achieve ~0.52 accuracy. This experiment tests the effect of switching RNA encoder from pca_n2000 to scvi_n200 in the same multimodal singleprofile setup, isolating the RNA encoder's impact. It directly addresses uncertainty about whether more sophisticated RNA encoders improve performance without changing other factors like image encoder or aggregation, aligning with principles of exploration and isolating design choices."
